# Rt56 2026-11-08 superseded the 2026-10-09 hand-patch this file used to carry.
#
# Back then `GXC_bai_chongxi` appeared as a bare scope directly under the idea's
# `available` OR, so the game evaluated `GXC_bai_chongxi = { is_hired_as_advisor
# = yes }` for every country in the world and each country without that character
# logged an invalid-scope error every tick.
#
# Upstream now guards both blocks itself:
#
#   AND = {
#     original_tag = GXC
#     GXC_bai_chongxi = { is_hired_as_advisor = yes }
#   }
#
# so only GXC ever evaluates the character scope, and the defect is gone at the
# source. The patch below would now fail the build ("block to remove not found")
# and, if it were retargeted at the new shape, would delete the upstream guard.
#
# Kept as an empty, documented include rather than deleted: the .include file is
# listed in the compile tree and its absence is silent, while this file explains
# why nothing is patched here. Revisit if upstream drops the guard again.
